tice</strong><span>Thursday • 19:00 • 30 min</span></div><div class="item-actions"><button class="icon">✓</button><button class="icon">×</button></div></div><div class="list-item row"><div><strong>Cyber lab / project</strong><span>Saturday • 19:00 • 1 hr 30 min</span></div><div class="item-actions"><button class="icon">✓</button><button class="icon">×</button></div></div><div class="list-item row"><div><strong>Plan the week</strong><span>Sunday • 19:00 • 10 min</span></div><div class="item-actions"><button class="icon">✓</button><button class="icon">×</button></div></div></div></div></section>

    <section class="view" id="cyber"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">CISO pathway</div><h2>Cybersecurity learning checklist</h2></div><button class="button" data-open="cyberModal">Add lesson</button></div><div class="card"><p class="muted">Small, legal learning steps. During exam weeks, pause this with zero guilt.</p><div class="progress"><i id="cyberProgress" style="width:0%"></i></div><span class="muted" id="cyberCount">0 of 7 lessons completed</span><div class="list" id="cyberList" style="margin-top:15px"><label class="check "><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>Computer &amp; internet basics</strong><br><span class="muted">Your next legal-learning step.</span></span><button class="icon" type="button">×</button></label><label class="check "><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>Networking foundations</strong><br><span class="muted">Your next legal-learning step.</span></span><button class="icon" type="button">×</button></label><label class="check "><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>Linux commands</strong><br><span class="muted">Your next legal-learning step.</span></span><button class="icon" type="button">×</button></label><label class="check "><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>Python basics</strong><br><span class="muted">Your next legal-learning step.</span></span><button class="icon" type="button">×</button></label><label class="check "><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>Security fundamentals</strong><br><span class="muted">Your next legal-learning step.</span></span><button class="icon" type="button">×</button></label><label class="check "><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>TryHackMe: Pre Security</strong><br><span class="muted">Your next legal-learning step.</span></span><button class="icon" type="button">×</button></label><label class="check "><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>TryHackMe: Cyber Security 101</strong><br><span class="muted">Your next legal-learning step.</span></span><button class="icon" type="button">×</button></label></div></div></section>

